  "reading": "うつろう",
  "romaji": "utsurou",
  "part_of_speech": "verb (godan)",
  "gloss": "to change; to shift; to fade",
  "definitions": [
    {
      "sense_number": 1,
      "gloss": "to change gradually; to shift; to fade",
      "explanation": "To change little by little and pass away, used of seasons, times, colors and feelings. A literary word."
    }
  ],
  "examples": [
    {
      "id": "32651_utsurou_ex1",
      "japanese": "⟦{季節|きせつ}→季節：01304_kisetsu⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{移|うつ}ろう。",
      "english": "The seasons change.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "32651_utsurou_ex2",
      "japanese": "⟦{人|ひと}→人：00476_hito⟧⟦の→の：09472_no⟧⟦{心|こころ}→心：01321_kokoro⟧⟦は→は：00079_ha⟧{移|うつ}ろいやすい。",
      "english": "People's hearts are fickle.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "32651_utsurou_ex3",
      "japanese": "⟦{窓|まど}→窓：02254_mado⟧⟦の→の：09472_no⟧⟦{外|そと}→外：00671_soto⟧⟦の→の：09472_no⟧⟦{景色|けしき}→景色：01395_keshiki⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{移|うつ}ろう⟦の→の：09472_no⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧、⟦{彼女|かのじょ}→彼女：01286_kanojo⟧⟦は→は：00079_ha⟧⟦{黙|だま}って→黙る：02287_damaru⟧⟦{眺|なが}めていた→眺める：02132_nagameru⟧。",
      "english": "She silently watched the scenery outside the window change.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    }
  ],
  "notes": "The noun ⟦{移|うつ}ろい→移ろい：20844_utsuroi⟧ (change, transience) is also common in writing.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {移|うつ}ろう⟦{季節|きせつ}→季節：01304_kisetsu⟧: the changing seasons\n- ⟦{時代|じだい}→時代：01424_jidai⟧⟦の→の：09472_no⟧⟦{移|うつ}ろい→移ろい：20844_utsuroi⟧: the passing of the times\n- {移|うつ}ろいやすい: fickle, changeable\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- ⟦{移|うつ}り{変|か}わる→移り変わる：19543_utsurikawaru⟧: to change, shift; the neutral word\n- ⟦{移|うつ}る→移る：01232_utsuru⟧: to move; to change",
